  ('skill_prompt-optimize', 'skills', 'prompt-optimize', 'prompt-optimize', '6-phase prompt analysis and optimisation', 'BuiltIn', '# Prompt Optimizer

Analyse and improve a prompt through structured evaluation.

## Steps
